abstract: >-
  Exact certificates and Python code for the finite arithmetic estimates in
  Exact complex coherence in codimension two. The paper determines the
  minimum coherence of N unit vectors in complex dimension N-2 for N >= 180,
  gives an explicit construction and classifies all equality cases.
